  _projectName: Masks, end me!
  _thumbnail: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 9ffabfae31121bf4fbf85ea0c2224ef5, type: 3}
  _videoDemoLink: https://github.com/AndrejKubik/InteractivePortfolio/releases/download/demo-videos/Masks.end.me.mp4
  _descriptionText: 'Prototype for a rogue-lite 3rd person shooter game about a magician
    fighting masked demons.


    - The demons attack you in waves and their numbers
    increase over time. Each demon has two hitboxes and you have to aim at them to
    deal damage while using the correct color of magic as well.'
  _developmentHighlights:
  - Name: 
    Text: Quick weapon change menu while holding right click
  - Name: 
    Text: Various demon attack types
  - Name: 
    Text: Character animations
  - Name: 
    Text: Round system, increasing number of demons every round and with bigger chance
      of stronger demons getting spawned
